  _headline: "M\xE1quina tira carbono do ar e guarda no subsolo"
  _headlineEn: Machine pulls carbon from the air, stores it underground
  _body: "Filtros e muita energia fazem o servi\xE7o, e a conta tamb\xE9m \xE9 grande.
    J\xFAlia pergunta se o ar vem com nota fiscal."
  _bodyEn: "Filters and lots of power do the job, and the bill is big too. J\xFAlia
    asks whether the air comes with a receipt."
